   325	\subsection{Simulation checks}
   326	
   327	The implementation checks use explicit-vs-operator simulations for the PLS
   328	covariance identity and the Ridge kernel identity.  These checks verify that
   329	for fixed folds and fixed strict operators, the folded computation matches
   330	the explicit transformed computation used by an external search.
