   334	The benchmark cohort is intentionally heterogeneous.  It combines public and
   335	local NIRS calibration tasks from leaf physiology, fruit quality, grain and
   336	seed traits, dairy, beverages, meat quality, petroleum, soil amendments, wood
   337	products and pharmaceutical tablets.  Several source databases contribute more
   338	than one response variable, so a row denotes a concrete prediction or
   339	classification task rather than only a spectral database.  The cohort covers
   340	small calibration settings, high-sample leaf datasets and several
   341	high-dimensional low-$n$ regimes.
