   211	\section{Operator Bank Exploration}
   212	
   213	The compact bank contains nine operators:
   214	\begin{equation}
   215	\begin{split}
   216	\mathcal A_{\mathrm{compact}}=\{&
   217	\mathrm{identity},
   218	\mathrm{SG}_{11,2}^{(0)},\mathrm{SG}_{21,3}^{(0)},
   219	\mathrm{SG}_{11,2}^{(1)},\mathrm{SG}_{21,3}^{(1)},\\
   220	&\mathrm{SG}_{11,2}^{(2)},
   221	\mathrm{detrend}_{1},\mathrm{detrend}_{2},
   222	\mathrm{FD}_{1}\}.
   223	\end{split}
   224	\end{equation}
   225	With $B$ operators and $K_{\max}$ component prefixes, the selector considers
